# This tape records the README animation with vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs): vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 820
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type "export PATH=/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-Mike-Documents-Github-perso-emploi/ac4b8479-4460-479a-8659-6b2991c00e05/scratchpad/bin:$PATH GITHUB_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "wormsign ConcordiaDev/theme_saimaniq"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
Sleep 4s
Type "echo $?"
Enter
Sleep 3s
